OL,3,GNEWSABackshall makes nature 'cool' to
OL,4,Ainspire children
OL,5,
OL,6,FWildlife presenter Steve Backshall has
OL,7,Ftold how he sets out to make nature
OL,8,F"adventurous" and "cool" for children
OL,9,Frather than preach to them.
OL,11,FThe presenter, known for programmes
OL,12,Fincluding Deadly 60, wants as many
OL,13,Fyoungsters as possible to be exposed to
OL,14,Fthe natural world.
OL,16,FHe spent his own childhood in a house
OL,17,Fin Surrey filled with rescue animals
OL,18,Fand said it helped inspire the passion
OL,19,Ffor wildlife that later shaped his
OL,20,Fcareer.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
