OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABackshall makes nature 'cool' to
OL,4,Ainspire children
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking in London ahead of his Deadly
OL,7,FLive show in Brighton on 29 October, he
OL,8,Fsaid what made his work exciting and
OL,9,Fworthwhile was seeing that there are
OL,10,F"thousands and thousands of kids out
OL,11,Fthere who have a passion for natural
OL,12,Fhistory".
